### LISTAGEM PAGINADA DE TIPOS DE EXAME
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tipo-exame
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Accept: application/json

### LISTAGEM PAGINADA DE TIPOS DE EXAME
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tipo-exame?sort=nome,desc&nome=URINA&codigo=2
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Accept: application/json

### LISTAGEM PAGINADA DE TIPOS DE EXAME
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tipo-exame?page=0&size=10&sort=nome&sort=codigo,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Accept: application/json